~ start

Guide: Welcome back.
Guide: The Seed Shop is nearby.
Guide: Buy 5 Corn Seeds and return when you're ready.

=> END


~ progress

Guide: Have you bought the Corn Seeds yet?
Guide: Bring me 5 Corn Seeds, then I'll teach you how to start your farm.

=> END


~ turn_in

Guide: Excellent!
Guide: You bought the Corn Seeds.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Guide: Before you begin, let me teach you the basics of farming.

Guide: You'll be using three essential tools.

Guide: Use the Hoe to till the soil.

Guide: Plant your Corn Seeds on the tilled land.

Guide: Water your crops every day with the Watering Can.

Guide: If weeds begin to grow, clear them with the Scythe.

Guide: Here, these tools are yours now.

do GameDialogueManager.action_teach_farming()

Guide: Now it's your turn.

do QuestManager.start_quest("first_harvest")

Guide: Harvest 5 Corn and come back to show me what you've learned.

=> END


~ completed

Guide: Good luck!
Guide: I'll be waiting for your first harvest.

=> END